{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05489","headline":"奉和姚令公驾幸温汤喜雪应制 · 苏绾","name":"奉和姚令公驾幸温汤喜雪应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉主新丰邑，周王尚父师。\n云符沛童唱，雪应海神期。\n林变惊春早，山明讶夕迟。\n况逢温液霈，恩重御裘诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏绾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}